  "body": "Auction: 62 Highbrook Drive, East Tamaki on Tuesday 24 November 2026 at 1:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n39 Quedley Court, Eastern Beach\r\n\r\nDiscover exceptional coastal living in one of East Auckland’s most sought-after neighbourhoods. Tucked away in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this impressive residence offers beautiful sea views, renovated interiors and generous family living.\r\n\r\nSet on 808m² of freehold land with 446m² of floor area, this substantial home combines space, privacy and comfort in a prestigious Eastern Beach location.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• 5 Bedrooms & 5 Bathrooms – Generous space for large or extended families.\r\n• 2 Spacious Living Areas – Perfect for family living and entertaining.\r\n• Concrete Exterior & Renovated Interiors – Solid exterior construction with stylish, refreshed living spaces.\r\n• 4 Balconies & Stunning Views – Enjoy beautiful sea views and distant SkyCity views.\r\n• Private Sauna & Spa – Your own relaxing retreat at home.\r\n• Double Garage & Fully Fenced Backyard – Secure parking, privacy and outdoor space.\r\n\r\nCoastal Lifestyle & Prime Location\r\nEnjoy morning walks along Eastern Beach, explore nearby Macleans Park and scenic walking trails, or relax at local cafés and restaurants around Half Moon Bay Marina and Howick Village.\r\n\r\nZoned for three sought-after schools:\r\n\r\nMacleans College | Bucklands Beach Intermediate | Pigeon Mountain School\r\n\r\nWith Highland Park Shopping Centre and Botany Town Centre within easy reach, everyday convenience is well taken care of.\r\n\r\nAUCTION – YOUR CHANCE TO SECURE IT!\r\n\r\nAn exceptional coastal home. A prestigious Eastern Beach address. A view worth coming home to.\r\n\r\nThe views will catch your eye. The space and lifestyle will make you want to stay.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss out — visit the open home and get ready to bid!",
